sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant EC2 as Legacy EC2 service
    participant TG as ALB Target Group plus TGB
    participant App as Application
    participant EKS as EKS StatefulSet
    participant Velero as Velero

    Note over Op,Velero: Phase 1 — provision parallel infra
    Op->>EKS: helm install cell N replica
    EKS-->>Op: pods Running and PVCs bound
    Op->>Velero: trigger snapshot from EC2-side LVM
    Velero->>EKS: restore PV data into EBS volumes
    Note right of Velero: Source-of-truth still EC2 — EKS is shadow-warm

    Note over Op,Velero: Phase 2 — verify shadow
    Op->>EKS: read-only verification probes
    EKS-->>Op: data parity confirmed

    Note over Op,Velero: Phase 3 — traffic flip via TGB
    Op->>TG: Update TargetGroupBinding weight 90 EC2 to 10 EKS
    TG->>App: routes 10 percent to EKS pods
    Note right of App: Application sees no change. Same DNS, same auth, same ALB
    Op->>TG: Increment to 50 EC2 to 50 EKS
    Op->>TG: Increment to 0 EC2 to 100 EKS
    Note right of TG: Soak window — monitor delta-replay and RPO

    Note over Op,Velero: Phase 4 — decommission legacy
    Op->>EC2: drain connections
    Op->>EC2: terminate instances and release EBS

    Note over Op,Velero: Anchor — application should not need to know it is being migrated
